  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-01-20T07:13:24.594Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'm on Windows 8.1. I'm assuming that the new video player is the problem, because when I switch to it in a cinema world, VRChat freezes the same way.\n\nWhen I join worlds that use the new video player by default, such as \"Alcoholics HQ\" by Passi, VRChat completely freezes after about 5 seconds (unrecoverable).\n\nI have a feeling the new video player is supported only by Windows 10 or something? Regardless, it would be nice if there was a fall back in place to prevent this very annoying freeze when trying to join friends in specific worlds.\n\nIf anyone knows any possible work-arounds, please let me know.",
